      "sourcePath": "source/components/index.mdx",
      "body": "---\ntitle: MDX Components\ndescription: Every note variant, inline code, tables, and links in one page.\nkeywords: [\"mdx\", \"components\", \"notes\"]\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n<Note title=\"Search index\">\n  Run `pnpm generate-content-json` after editing docs.\n</Note>\n\n<Note title=\"Warning\" type=\"warning\">\n  Set `AI_API_KEY` before enabling Chat with Docs in production.\n</Note>\n\n<Note title=\"Danger\" type=\"danger\">\n  Do not expose provider secrets as public Vite environment variables.\n</Note>\n\n## Standard Markdown\n\nInline `code`, **bold**, _italic_, and a [relative link](/quickstart) plus an [external link](https://doxa.so).\n\n| Option | Default | Meaning |\n| ------ | ------- | ------- |\n| `port` | `3000`  | The dev server port. |\n| `open` | `false` | Open the browser on start. |\n\n```ts title=\"example.ts\"\nexport function greet(name: string): string {\n  return `Hello, ${name}`;\n}\n```\n\n> A block quote survives the round trip.\n\n1. First ordered item.\n2. Second ordered item.\n\n- First unordered item.\n- Second unordered item.\n",
